1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:04,268
Imagine stepping out of your suite and
sliding straight into a pool.

2
00:00:04,398 --> 00:00:09,176
That's a Swim Out suite at Secrets Cap
Cana, an adults-only resort on Juanillo

3
00:00:09,206 --> 00:00:10,470
Beach, in Punta Cana.

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:16,006
Five stars on Expedia, and a nine point
two out of ten from a thousand guests.

5
00:00:16,136 --> 00:00:20,989
In this tour: the suites, the beach, eight
restaurants, and a Queen tribute show.

6
00:00:21,119 --> 00:00:24,953
I'll show you which suite to pick, and my
honest score comes last.

7
00:00:25,083 --> 00:00:26,248
First, the suites.

8
00:00:26,378 --> 00:00:30,803
There are four hundred fifty-seven rooms,
and the Swim Out ones open straight onto

9
00:00:30,833 --> 00:00:31,346
the water.

10
00:00:31,476 --> 00:00:36,426
Guests rate the Junior Suite Swim Out with
two beds nine point six out of ten.

11
00:00:36,556 --> 00:00:40,792
Every room has a free stocked minibar,
bathrobes and premium bedding.

12
00:00:40,922 --> 00:00:44,686
Many rooms come with a balcony or patio,
and the beach is part of the view.

13
00:00:44,816 --> 00:00:45,851
Now, the beach.

14
00:00:45,981 --> 00:00:50,530
Juanillo Beach is soft white sand, and
staff bring cocktails to your lounger.

15
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:54,373
There are two outdoor pools, two hot tubs,
and a poolside bar.

16
00:00:54,503 --> 00:00:59,033
Snorkeling, a scuba lesson in the pool,
and water aerobics are all on the activity

17
00:00:59,063 --> 00:00:59,311
list.

18
00:00:59,441 --> 00:01:03,827
After dark, there are movies on a big
screen on the beach, and weekly theme
nights.

19
00:01:03,957 --> 00:01:04,753
Now, the food.

20
00:01:04,883 --> 00:01:10,041
Expedia counts eight restaurants, from
pan-Asian to authentic Mexican, with ocean

21
00:01:10,071 --> 00:01:10,425
views.

22
00:01:10,555 --> 00:01:16,103
The resort lists Himitsu for pan-Asian,
Oceana for seafood, Portofino for Italian,

23
00:01:16,133 --> 00:01:17,464
and a Seaside Grill.

24
00:01:17,594 --> 00:01:22,202
Market Café is the international buffet,
and a breakfast buffet is included.

25
00:01:22,332 --> 00:01:25,458
And reservations are never required,
according to the resort.

26
00:01:25,588 --> 00:01:30,490
Top-shelf spirits flow at six bars and
lounges, including two beach and pool
bars.

27
00:01:30,620 --> 00:01:33,471
Opening hours aren't published on the
pages I checked.

28
00:01:33,601 --> 00:01:35,106
Now, the spa and the evenings.

29
00:01:35,236 --> 00:01:40,704
The spa is run by Pevonia, with
hydrotherapy, a seaweed wrap, and Swedish
massage on

30
00:01:40,734 --> 00:01:41,293
the menu.

31
00:01:41,423 --> 00:01:43,812
Spa hours aren't published either, so book
ahead.

32
00:01:43,942 --> 00:01:46,881
At Yinandi Lounge, there's a Queen tribute
show.

33
00:01:47,011 --> 00:01:50,398
There's also an indoor theatre, plus dance
and Spanish lessons.

34
00:01:50,528 --> 00:01:54,281
Secrets Cap Cana sits inside the gated
community of Cap Cana.

35
00:01:54,411 --> 00:01:59,665
One guest called it secluded and safe, and
the Cap Cana marina is about ten minutes

36
00:01:59,695 --> 00:01:59,983
away.

37
00:02:00,113 --> 00:02:02,840
The airport is around eighteen minutes by
car.

38
00:02:02,970 --> 00:02:08,540
Nearby: El Dorado Water Park, Bavaro
Adventure Park, and Downtown Punta Cana.

39
00:02:08,946 --> 00:02:09,802
A few tips.

40
00:02:10,092 --> 00:02:14,220
It's adults only, eighteen and over, so it
suits couples and friends.

41
00:02:14,350 --> 00:02:17,643
Check in is at 3 PM, and check out is
before noon.

42
00:02:17,773 --> 00:02:20,377
Parking is free, and so are bicycles.

43
00:02:20,507 --> 00:02:25,147
Some guests found the food hit or miss, so
lean on the buffet, which one guest

44
00:02:25,177 --> 00:02:26,524
called the best option.

45
00:02:26,654 --> 00:02:31,083
And if you want a big party scene, one
guest found the entertainment a bit quiet.

46
00:02:31,213 --> 00:02:32,594
So, is it worth it?

47
00:02:32,724 --> 00:02:37,572
Nine point two out of ten, and seven
hundred sixty-eight guests gave a perfect
ten.

48
00:02:37,702 --> 00:02:40,069
Cleanliness scores nine point eight.

49
00:02:40,199 --> 00:02:42,777
My honest score: eight and a half out of
ten.

50
00:02:42,907 --> 00:02:47,748
Perfect for couples who want a quiet
beach, Swim Out suites, and unlimited
drinks.

51
00:02:47,878 --> 00:02:50,162
The link is in the description.
